  "text": "Silver Price in the 2010s\nBetween the first (2010-01-29) and last (2019-12-31) monthly observations available for the 2010s, the LBMA silver price went from $16.29 to $18.05 — a gain of 11% — with a sampled high of $48.70 (Apr 2011) and a sampled low of $13.82 (Dec 2015).\nYears in the 2010s\n2010\n2011\n2012\n2013\n2014\n2015\n2016\n2017\n2018\n2019\nSee today's live silver price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop silver bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
